T* (### The Three-Beat Execution Framework \(Week 2 Shape\)) Tj
T* (Every new piece of work added to this platform follows the verified 3-beat rhythm:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. **Beat 1: The Problem \(Context, Friction & Human Reality\)**) Tj
T* (   - *What was broken or missing before?*) Tj
T* (   - *Focus:* Identify the raw human, operational, or ecological constraint before technology was introduced \(e.g., smallholder beekeepers in semi-arid Kenya losing up to 40% of their honey harvest because rural hive absconding and swarming cannot be detected without manual, disruptive box opening\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. **Beat 2: What I Did \(Architecture, Constraints & Deliberate Trade-offs\)**) Tj
T* (   - *What technical choices were made, and why?*) Tj
T* (   - *Focus:* Document engineering decisions, trade-offs, and tool selection with transparency. Explain why one path was chosen over an easier alternative \(e.g., opting for an offline USSD/SMS fallback gateway over a smartphone-only web app to guarantee 100% reach for pastoralist farmers with feature phones\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. **Beat 3: What Came of It \(Measurable Impact, Data & Honest Reflection\)**) Tj
T* (   - *What was the real outcome?*) Tj
T* (   - *Focus:* Deliver quantifiable numbers, operational gains, and what was learned \(e.g., telemetry latency dropped under 2 seconds, farmer harvest yields grew 4x from 8kg to 35kg/box, and verified zero WCAG AA accessibility violations\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* () Tj
