T* (2. The Named Next Real Piece of Work) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
T* () Tj
T* (* **Project Title:** **EcoHive LoRaWAN Hardware Gateway & USSD Farmer Alert Engine**) Tj
T* (* **Executive Summary:** Designing the physical IoT receiver layer that bridges field sensor telemetry from solar-powered beehives in Baringo and Nakuru directly into an Africa's Talking USSD/SMS gateway. This allows pastoralist Kenyan beekeepers without smartphones or internet access to receive real-time Swahili text alerts for hive weight surges and swarming frequencies \(450–500 Hz\).) Tj
T* (* **Technical Scope:** ) Tj
T* (  - Microcontroller firmware \(ESP32 + SX1276 LoRa transceiver\).) Tj
T* (  - Africa's Talking SMS API webhook handler in Node.js/Express.) Tj
T* (  - Multi-lingual SMS parsing \(English and Swahili prompt sets\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* () Tj
